{"name": "Vault Raiders", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vault Raiders is a roguelite tactical deckbuilder where your position matters as much as your deck. Read enemy intentions, unleash devastating card combinations, and turn overwhelming odds into the perfect play as you fight your way through a buried Vault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the world ended, the rich and powerful sealed themselves inside Vaults. Hundreds of years later, you're going in. Their riches are yours for the taking.\u00a0</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"A hooded raider sits by a fire at night, looking across the flats at a lit vault door set into a cliff.\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5255890/extras/f6d335d409ef39da5174097d37eccb00.avif?t=1794067114\" width=\"1280\"/></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Every room is a puzzle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every enemy shows its hand before it moves. Read the room, duck into cover, find a flank, and turn overwhelming odds into the perfect play. Your position matters as much as your deck.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"The Marauder plays a Shoot card from a full hand. The camera cuts to a close-up of the rifle firing, and the enemy falls.\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5255890/extras/b4c1eaffa282fd18a65d97690145e1de.poster.avif?t=1794067114\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5255890/extras/b4c1eaffa282fd18a65d97690145e1de.webm?t=1794067114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5255890/extras/b4c1eaffa282fd18a65d97690145e1de.mp4?t=1794067114\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock devastating synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every card you add and every Artifact you discover changes how you fight. Stack Augments that rewrite the rules of combat, find the Artifact that ties your deck together, and watch your run snowball into an unstoppable force.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"The Ghost faces a Warden, Archon, Vaultguard and Conscript in a teal-and-gold Act III room, with a full hand of ten cards and seven Artifacts.\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5255890/extras_big/1de9060eb67d54a4e3222d44434350b3.avif?t=1794067114\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5255890/extras/1de9060eb67d54a4e3222d44434350b3.avif?t=1794067114\" width=\"1560\"/></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The deeper you go</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rival crews hold the upper floors. Below them, the biolabs crawl with infected test subjects. At the bottom, the Vault\u2019s elite hide behind armored guards and war machines. Choose your path through fights, shops, and the unknown. How far can you go?</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Three panels: a raider at a sandbag checkpoint, an overrun biolab with glowing green pods, and the Vault\u2019s elite watching an armed raider in their doorway.\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5255890/extras_big/9d11415127fdfb7bbf6f924adf4a7ea9.avif?t=1794067114\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5255890/extras/9d11415127fdfb7bbf6f924adf4a7ea9.avif?t=1794067114\" width=\"1560\"/></span> </div>", "short_desc": "Every room is a puzzle. Every action is a card. Read enemy intentions and fight for position in this roguelite tactical deckbuilder.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5255890/3aa13ed6db67b8a4fe26efd31171510fe6a86363/header.jpg?t=1794067114", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Deckbuilding", "Tactical", "Strategy", "Roguelite"], "developers": "Magic Bullet Games", "publishers": "Magic Bullet Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5255890", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/nh0zzSxgXjQ", "first_seen": 1794956400.0, "review_rank": 12}